## Notes / open items
- **Debit-pay bill payment** is the standout: **Capital on Tap** confirmed allows paying the card balance with a debit card (Payments page). Corporate charge cards (Brex, Ramp, Divvy/BILL, Rho, Mercury IO, Airbase) settle by ACH/bank autopay only = **No**. Consumer Synchrony cards (Venmo, PayPal) and Robinhood/SoFi debit-pay status marked NEEDS RESEARCH pending issuer FAQ confirmation.
- **Costco/grocery**: Only flat-rate Visa cards (Capital on Tap 1.5%, Robinhood 3%) reliably earn at Costco. Category-grocery cards (Venmo, PayPal debit) exclude Costco because it codes as warehouse-club MCC 5300. Mastercard cards (Brex, Mercury IO, PayPal, SoFi) can't be swiped at Costco in-warehouse at all.
- Several issuing-bank and exact-rate fields are marked NEEDS RESEARCH; being verified via live web research and will be updated.
